    {
      "voiceId": "meghan-mccain",
      "voiceName": "Meghan McCain",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "I mean gallivanting around New York City while having the Ebola virus isn\u2019t great.\n\n\nCraig Spencer MD MPH (@Craig_A_Spencer)\n\nthat guy was THE WORST\n\n\n\n\u2014 https://nitter.net/Craig_A_Spencer/status/2056183621375971660#m",
