      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "meghan-mccain",
      "voiceName": "Meghan McCain",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "I remember when that Ebola doctor came back from Africa and went to the meatball shop, gutter bar and in Ubers all around New York City in the Obama years\u2026\n\n\nNeil Stone (@DrNeilStone)\n\nIf you live in DR Congo \ud83c\udde8\ud83c\udde9, Uganda \ud83c\uddfa\ud83c\uddec, or other countries in the Central /East Africa region , Ebola is a real concern .\n\nI doubt it will spread far beyond that region but millions of people live there and I'm concerned for them .\n\n\n\n\u2014 https://nitter.net/DrNeilStone/status/2056065476443160926#m",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/MeghanMcCain/status/2056078654065562044",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-17T18:25:25+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
